(🇬🇧&amp;🇹🇷)

Greetings,
After confirmation structures formed at the resistance levels we identified, I entered a short position (check the 4th screenshot to see how you can use confirmation).

Once price reached the predefined support zone, instead of closing the short, I initiated a hedge long position equal to half the size of the short.

If price continues lower toward the other support level at $23.7, I plan to add additional long exposure, effectively aiming to realize the short position as close to the local bottom as possible.

To protect the position, I’ve moved the stop on the short to my entry level.

Given that we’ve structured solid setups on both sides, both positions should remain profitable. Those who prefer can close everything. My intention here was to provide a practical projection in response to the frequent question: “How do you manage your positions?”

Wishing everyone a blessed Friday and a great day ahead.

For the Turkish 🇹🇷 version 👇</span></div><div class="relative"><div class="aspect-[25/17] overflow-hidden"><div class="scrollbar-hide flex h-full min-h-0 snap-x snap-mandatory gap-2 overflow-x-auto [&amp;::-webkit-scrollbar]:hidden"><div class="h-full min-h-0 w-[85%] shrink-0 snap-center overflow-hidden rounded-md border border-gray-200"><div class="relative h-full w-full"><div inert="" class="h-full w-full"><a aria-label="Image" class="block h-full w-full cursor-zoom-in appearance-none border-none bg-transparent p-0 text-inherit" href="/Efloud/status/2017179899195175355/photo/1"><img alt="" class="h-full w-full object-cover" loading="eager" fetchPriority="high" width="3286" height="1858" src="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G_50W4KW4AA5kpE?format=webp&amp;name=medium" srcSet="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G_50W4KW4AA5kpE?format=webp&amp;name=small 680w, https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G_50W4KW4AA5kpE?format=webp&amp;name=medium 1200w, https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G_50W4KW4AA5kpE?format=webp&amp;name=large 2048w" sizes="(max-width: 600px) calc(100vw - 80px), 600px"/></a></div><a aria-label="View media" class="absolute inset-0 z-10" href="/Efloud/status/2017179899195175355/photo/1"></a></div></div><div class="h-full min-h-0 w-[85%] shrink-0 snap-center overflow-hidden rounded-md border border-gray-200"><div class="relative h-full w-full"><div inert="" class="h-full w-full"><a aria-label="Image" class="block h-full w-full cursor-zoom-in appearance-none border-none bg-transparent p-0 text-inherit" href="/Efloud/status/2017179899195175355/photo/2"><img alt="" class="h-full w-full object-cover" loading="lazy" width="750" height="1120" src="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G_50aFHXcAEvraL?format=webp&amp;name=medium" srcSet="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G_50aFHXcAEvraL?format=webp&amp;name=small 680w, https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G_50aFHXcAEvraL?format=webp&amp;name=medium 1200w, https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G_50aFHXcAEvraL?format=webp&amp;name=large 2048w" sizes="(max-width: 600px) calc(10